<title>FRANCE: Credit Foncier staff to free boss - unions.</title>
<headline>Credit Foncier staff to free boss - unions.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Workers at French bank Credit Foncier will free chairman Jerome Meyssonnier imminently, a spokesman for the trade unions said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Meyssonnier has been held at the headquarters for six days by staff opposed to government plans to break up the 145-year-old bank.</p>
